  "device": "Behringer BCR2000",
  "evidence": {
    "authority": "manufacturer-sheet + community-code cross-check",
    "lineage": "CC numbers transcribed from both authorities; nothing reverse-engineered",
    "source": "Behringer BCR2000 preset sheets (factory preset 1 'Only Controllers, CC 1-110, all on MIDI Ch.1') cross-checked against Mixxx's Behringer-BCR2000-preset-scripts.js constants (push groups start 0x01, button offset 0x20, button rows 0x41, encoder rows 0x51, button box 0x69) - the two sources agree exactly",
    "url": "https://images.thomann.de/pics/prod/168768_preset.pdf + https://github.com/mixxxdj/mixxx/blob/master/res/controllers/Behringer-BCR2000-preset-scripts.js",
    "verified_on": "2026-11-10"
  },
  "firmware_basis": "factory preset 1 (Only Controllers)",
  "match": {
    "name_contains": "BCR"
  },
  "notes": [
    "Assumes factory preset 1: recall it with the PRESET keys (top-right) or a factory reset. If your preset differs, twist a control here and use passive-learn / rebind - the console follows YOUR wire, not this sheet.",
    "The 8 PUSH ENCODERS (top-left) are the unique knobs: TURN sends absolute CC 1-8, the built-in PUSH button sends CC 33-40. Both are mapped here as a knob + its momentary directly below.",
    "Factory preset 1 encoders are ABSOLUTE CC (0-127 position), not relative. In EDIT mode they can be set Relative 1/2/3 or 14-bit - then the console shows deltas; re-learn if you do.",
    "ENCODER GROUPS: the 24 rotaries are grouped in 6s by COLUMNS (group 1 = encoders 1-2, 9-10, 17-18 ... group 4 = 7-8, 15-16, 23-24). The group-select keys send Program Change on ch 11 - not CC-bindable, so they are a label here.",
    "Buttons default to Toggle On (press=127, press again=0; release ignored). Mixxx recommends Toggle Off (release=0): hold EDIT, press a button, set MODE encoder to toFF, EXIT, Store twice. Momentary cards show both edges either way.",
    "The 4-digit LED display and the LED rings are device-side feedback - the console does not write them (does_not_claim).",
    "Footswitch jacks default to Bank Select CC 0-3 on ch 1 - not mapped (add via rebind if you use them).",
    "If the friend's 'CONTROL 2000' is actually the BCF2000 (the fader version): the 8 motorized faders use the same CC 1-8 scheme, so this profile maps them too - copy it and rename the knobs to faders."
  ],
  "profile_id": "behringer-bcr2000",
